1654
02:03:04,740 --> 02:03:10,140
On May 25th residents in parts of South Huntsville experienced a power outage beginning at 3am.

1655
02:03:10,140 --> 02:03:14,780
This outage was caused by a large tree that fell in the Weatherly area bringing down power

1656
02:03:14,780 --> 02:03:17,380
lines, utility poles and attached equipment.

1657
02:03:17,380 --> 02:03:21,340
Additionally another outage in the Bailey Cove and Mountain Gap areas later in the morning

1658
02:03:21,340 --> 02:03:25,140
was caused by a power line becoming disconnected from an insulator.

1659
02:03:25,140 --> 02:03:30,340
There were several posts that suggested or claimed that Huntsville utilities was diverting

1660
02:03:30,340 --> 02:03:35,940
electricity away from residents in the affected area to Metta's data center during the outage.

1661
02:03:35,940 --> 02:03:39,460
This post is absolutely false.

1662
02:03:39,460 --> 02:03:44,100
Metta's data center in Huntsville, Alabama does not receive electricity from Huntsville

1663
02:03:44,100 --> 02:03:45,100
utilities.

1664
02:03:45,100 --> 02:03:48,340
It is served directly from the Tennessee Valley Authority, TVA.

1665
02:03:48,340 --> 02:03:53,380
At no time was Huntsville utilities diverting power away from customers anywhere in the

1666
02:03:53,380 --> 02:03:55,540
service area.

1667
02:03:55,540 --> 02:04:00,420
That same day that I received that email I also received a report from Huntsville utilities

1668
02:04:00,420 --> 02:04:09,140
on outages in the Hillwood Heritage Estates area off of Mountain Gap and it was an analysis

1669
02:04:09,140 --> 02:04:11,860
of what had caused those utilities.

1670
02:04:11,860 --> 02:04:13,700
I don't think this is unusual.

1671
02:04:13,700 --> 02:04:17,540
I think this is probably true in every neighborhood but I found it interesting.

1672
02:04:17,540 --> 02:04:19,820
Six outages affected the area.

1673
02:04:19,820 --> 02:04:21,660
Four were caused by squirrels.

1674
02:04:21,660 --> 02:04:25,340
Two were caused by a possible transformer overload.

1675
02:04:25,340 --> 02:04:27,580
Three outages occurred at the same address.

1676
02:04:27,580 --> 02:04:32,060
The first was a squirrel while the next two were transformer overload.

1677
02:04:32,060 --> 02:04:34,260
Five blinks affected the area.

1678
02:04:34,260 --> 02:04:38,980
Four were involved in the Meadowbrook recloser operating.

1679
02:04:38,980 --> 02:04:44,260
Two were associated with squirrel outages and two were unrelated to any outages.

1680
02:04:44,260 --> 02:04:48,340
One was related to a TVA issue.

1681
02:04:48,340 --> 02:04:55,300
So we need to be careful about making assumptions about the outages.

1682
02:04:55,300 --> 02:04:58,700
Apparently squirrels and trees are our greatest hazard with those.

1683
02:04:58,700 --> 02:05:01,740
So just want everyone to be aware of that.

