2547
02:55:58,180 --> 02:56:01,740
We have, we've never had a TIF district go the full term.

2548
02:56:01,740 --> 02:56:03,740
They've went as short as six years.

2549
02:56:03,740 --> 02:56:05,340
It's been the quickest.

2550
02:56:05,340 --> 02:56:08,460
That was TIF, well, two really.

2551
02:56:08,460 --> 02:56:11,300
I think the very first TIF we did, we were learning.

2552
02:56:11,300 --> 02:56:12,580
It was a very small TIF.

2553
02:56:12,580 --> 02:56:15,060
It was US Highway 72 West,

2554
02:56:15,060 --> 02:56:16,540
just West Research Park Boulevard.

2555
02:56:16,540 --> 02:56:20,660
We widen from Research Park Boulevard to Providence, Maine.

2556
02:56:20,660 --> 02:56:23,620
It brought in the Target Center and all that retail

2557
02:56:23,620 --> 02:56:25,580
and all that development you see there.

2558
02:56:26,620 --> 02:56:30,380
I believe that TIF was only about $3 million

2559
02:56:30,380 --> 02:56:32,900
and it only lasted three, maybe three and a half,

2560
02:56:32,900 --> 02:56:34,940
four years, I'm going from memory.

2561
02:56:34,940 --> 02:56:37,260
But the latest TIF was TIF six.

2562
02:56:37,260 --> 02:56:39,140
It helped build Greenbower Parkway,

2563
02:56:39,140 --> 02:56:41,100
do some improvements to exit three,

2564
02:56:41,100 --> 02:56:43,300
extend some utilities.

2565
02:56:43,300 --> 02:56:48,300
Today we've put, seen private investment exceed $6 billion

2566
02:56:48,300 --> 02:56:50,620
and 16,000 jobs at that exit.

2567
02:56:50,620 --> 02:56:52,260
That TIF paid off in six years.

2568
02:56:53,600 --> 02:56:55,540
Any other questions?

2569
02:56:55,540 --> 02:56:56,980
All in favor, please indicate.

2570
02:56:56,980 --> 02:56:57,820
Aye.

2571
02:56:57,820 --> 02:56:58,980
Any opposed?

2572
02:56:58,980 --> 02:57:00,580
Motion carries.

2573
02:57:00,580 --> 02:57:01,700
Thank you, Mr. Davis.

2574
02:57:01,700 --> 02:57:02,900
Thank you, Council Member.

2575
02:57:02,900 --> 02:57:06,860
20G is resolution urging action on roadway noise

2576
02:57:06,860 --> 02:57:08,400
impacting Sherwood Park.

2577
02:57:08,400 --> 02:57:11,780
Mr. Kling, I'll bet you'd like to make a motion on that.

2578
02:57:11,780 --> 02:57:13,260
Move to approve.

2579
02:57:13,260 --> 02:57:14,940
Second for Mr. Meredith.

2580
02:57:14,940 --> 02:57:17,140
We've heard a lot about this tonight, Mr. Davis.

2581
02:57:17,140 --> 02:57:20,140
Madam President, I know we've been around on this

2582
02:57:20,140 --> 02:57:21,820
and you've heard our discussion.

2583
02:57:21,820 --> 02:57:26,820
Very, very basically what this does is it calls upon

2584
02:57:26,820 --> 02:57:29,200
the Metropolitan Planning Organization,

2585
02:57:29,200 --> 02:57:32,080
which has a very close working relationship

2586
02:57:32,080 --> 02:57:34,600
with the Alabama Department of Transportation.

2587
02:57:34,600 --> 02:57:38,440
And basically we are asking the MPO to contact

2588
02:57:38,440 --> 02:57:40,680
the Alabama Department of Transportation

2589
02:57:40,680 --> 02:57:44,600
